meta {
  name: Get Feed - filter=subscribed
  type: http
  seq: 107
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?filter=subscribed
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Issue #49: feed restricted to posts whose tags the caller subscribes to.

  testuser has zero seeded subscriptions, so the response will be an
  empty posts array — but the endpoint returns 200 (not 404), proving
  the schema accepts 'subscribed' as a valid filter.

  When the caller has subscriptions, the SQL reuses the same EXISTS
  predicate the personalized sort uses.
}
